---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Toc from "../components/Toc.astro";
import Callout from "../components/Callout.astro";
import { DISCORD_INVITE_URL, ECON } from "../consts";

const sections = [
  { href: "#getting-around", label: "Getting around" },
  { href: "#personal", label: "Homes & personal" },
  { href: "#chat", label: "Communication" },
  { href: "#economy", label: "Economy & shops" },
  { href: "#voting", label: "Voting & crates" },
  { href: "#land", label: "Land & nation" },
  { href: "#war", label: "Warfare" },
];
---

<Base
  title="Commands · Meridian"
  description="The Meridian commands you will actually use: movement, land, economy, shops, voting, and war."
  path="/commands"
  ogDescription="The Meridian commands you will actually use: movement, land, economy, shops, voting, and war."
>
<main class="doc">
  <h1>Commands</h1>
  <p class="lead">The commands you'll reach for most often. Arguments in <code>&lt;angle brackets&gt;</code> are required; <code>[square brackets]</code> are optional. Some commands depend on your rank or your permissions inside a land.</p>

  <Toc sections={sections} ariaLabel="Jump to a command group" />

  <div class="acc">
  <details class="acc-item" open>
    <summary><h2 id="getting-around">Getting around</h2></summary>
    <div class="cmd-group">
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/back</code></div><div class="desc">Return to your last location, including your death point.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/tpa &lt;player&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Ask to teleport to a player. <code>/tpahere &lt;player&gt;</code> asks them to come to you.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/tpaccept</code> <code>/tpdeny</code></div><div class="desc">Answer a teleport request. Requests expire after two minutes.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands spawn</code></div><div class="desc">Teleport to your land's spawn point.</div></div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="acc-item">
    <summary><h2 id="personal">Homes &amp; personal</h2></summary>
    <div class="cmd-group">
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/sethome [name]</code></div><div class="desc">Set a home where you're standing. Your home limit depends on your rank.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/home [name]</code></div><div class="desc">Teleport to a home. <code>/homes</code> lists them.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/delhome &lt;name&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Delete a home.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/afk</code></div><div class="desc">Toggle your AFK status.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/rules</code> <code>/motd</code></div><div class="desc">Show the rules / message of the day in chat.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/calc &lt;expression&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">A calculator in chat, with Minecraft shortcuts for stacks, farm rates, and travel distance.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/imageframe create &lt;name&gt; &lt;url&gt; &lt;width&gt; &lt;height&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Put an image from a URL onto item frames. Width and height are in frames; no blank maps needed. Up to 25 images per player.</div></div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="acc-item">
    <summary><h2 id="chat">Communication</h2></summary>
    <div class="cmd-group">
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/msg &lt;player&gt; &lt;text&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Private message. <code>/r &lt;text&gt;</code> replies to the last one.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/mail send &lt;player&gt; &lt;text&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Leave a message for an offline player. <code>/mail read</code> to check yours.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands chat</code></div><div class="desc">Toggle land-only chat (also <code>/lc</code>).</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/ignore &lt;player&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Stop seeing a player's messages.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/voicechat</code></div><div class="desc">Voice chat settings. Needs the Simple Voice Chat mod on your client; press <kbd>V</kbd> in-game for the menu and group channels.</div></div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="acc-item">
    <summary><h2 id="economy">Economy &amp; shops</h2></summary>
    <div class="cmd-group">
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/balance [player]</code></div><div class="desc">The gold you are carrying (also <code>/bal</code>). Gold ingots and blocks in your inventory are your balance; there is no bank.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/pay &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Hand gold from your inventory to another player.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/baltop</code></div><div class="desc">Who is carrying the most gold.</div></div>
    <p class="cmd-note">Chest shops (QuickShop-Hikari)</p>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>left-click a chest</code></div><div class="desc">While holding an item, left-click a chest to start a shop, then type a price.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/qs price &lt;amount&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Change the price of the shop you're looking at.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/qs find &lt;item&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Locate nearby shops selling an item.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/qs staff add &lt;player&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Let someone help manage your shop.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/qs remove</code></div><div class="desc">Remove the shop you're looking at.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/bottle [amount]</code></div><div class="desc">Bottle your XP so it can be carried, stored or traded.</div></div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="acc-item">
    <summary><h2 id="voting">Voting &amp; crates</h2></summary>
    <div class="cmd-group">
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/vote</code></div><div class="desc">Links for our four listing sites. Each can be voted once every 24 hours, and every vote pays a Copper Crate.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/crates</code></div><div class="desc">Open the crates you hold. Crates never take an inventory slot. They're held for you until you open them.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/keys</code></div><div class="desc">How many of each crate you're currently holding.</div></div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="acc-item">
    <summary><h2 id="land">Land &amp; nation</h2></summary>
    <div class="cmd-group">
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands menu</code></div><div class="desc">Open the main Lands GUI. Everything below is in here too. <code>/l</code>, <code>/ls</code>, and <code>/t</code> all work as shorthand for <code>/lands</code>; <code>/n</code> for <code>/nation</code>.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands create &lt;name&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Found a land. The first chunk is free, and you can own up to two lands.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands claim</code> <code>/lands unclaim</code></div><div class="desc">Claim or release the chunk you're standing in. Each chunk costs {ECON.chunkCost} from the land bank.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands map</code></div><div class="desc">Show a chunk map of nearby claims.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands view</code></div><div class="desc">Visualize your land's borders.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands trust &lt;player&gt;</code> <code>/lands untrust &lt;player&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Add or remove a trusted member.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands info</code></div><div class="desc">Tier, chunk count, members, and bank.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands bank deposit &lt;amount&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Fund the land bank (also <code>withdraw</code>, <code>balance</code>).</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands rent</code> <code>/lands sell</code></div><div class="desc">Rent or sell a sub-area to another player.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands setspawn</code></div><div class="desc">Set where <code>/lands spawn</code> takes members.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/lands list</code></div><div class="desc">Browse every land on the server. Lands can be tagged as shops or mob farms, so this doubles as the shop directory.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/nation create &lt;name&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Form a nation from your land ({ECON.nationCreateCost}).</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/nation &lt;nation&gt; invite &lt;land&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">Invite another land into your nation.</div></div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="acc-item">
    <summary><h2 id="war">Warfare</h2></summary>
    <div class="cmd-group">
    <Callout compact>War declarations must be approved by staff in a <a href={DISCORD_INVITE_URL} rel="noopener">Discord</a> ticket <em>first</em>. Only then do you file it in-game. See <a href="/war">Warfare</a>.</Callout>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/nation &lt;your_nation&gt; war declare &lt;target&gt;</code></div><div class="desc">File an approved declaration. Starts the 2-day grace period.</div></div>
    <div class="cmd"><div class="k"><code>/nation &lt;nation&gt; relations</code></div><div class="desc">Check standing wars, alliances, and truces.</div></div>
    </div>
  </details>
  </div>

  <p class="editnote">Command names follow the plugins Meridian runs (Lands, QuickShop-Hikari, TheNewEconomy, EssentialsX, VotingPlugin, CrazyCrates, CalcMod, ImageFrame, Simple Voice Chat). If any alias differs on the server, tell staff and this page will be corrected.</p>
</main>
</Base>
